  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukrainian-Danish Youth House 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at promoting youth engagement and democracy by offering youths a hub and activities that focus on furthering democracy and democratic leadership. The outcome is therefore to strengthen the youth&apos;s democratic voice and engagement and thereby also strengthening civil society in Ukraine.</narrative>
